    "detailed_description": "Battle for victory by casting a variety of spells on your opponents until there's only one mage (or team) standing.  Purchase new spells between rounds using coins you've earned during the fight.  Every game is different, with randomly-generated terrain, randomly-positioned mages and 10 unique spells to choose from (some of which are affected by wind).  Play by yourself, with others online and computer opponents in teams or free-for-all.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/662720/extras/4b59be0a3c8dae4553eada0ea4223f62.poster.avif?t=1706676289\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/662720/extras/4b59be0a3c8dae4553eada0ea4223f62.webm?t=1706676289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/662720/extras/4b59be0a3c8dae4553eada0ea4223f62.mp4?t=1706676289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><u><strong>Customize Your Game</strong></u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play with 2 to 24 mages with any combination of players and computers<br></li><li>Set your team settings: number of teams and number of mages on each team or free-for-all<br></li><li>Select each computer's skill, from random to accurate<br></li><li>Adjust wind settings from none to strong<br></li><li>Choose the total number of rounds, maximum turns in each round and the length of each turn</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Battle for victory by casting a variety of spells on your opponents until there's only one mage (or team) standing.  Purchase new spells between rounds using coins you've earned during the fight.  Every game is different, with randomly-generated terrain, randomly-positioned mages and 10 unique spells to choose from (some of which are affected by wind).  Play by yourself, with others online and computer opponents in teams or free-for-all.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/662720/extras/4b59be0a3c8dae4553eada0ea4223f62.poster.avif?t=1706676289\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/662720/extras/4b59be0a3c8dae4553eada0ea4223f62.webm?t=1706676289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/662720/extras/4b59be0a3c8dae4553eada0ea4223f62.mp4?t=1706676289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><u><strong>Customize Your Game</strong></u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play with 2 to 24 mages with any combination of players and computers<br></li><li>Set your team settings: number of teams and number of mages on each team or free-for-all<br></li><li>Select each computer's skill, from random to accurate<br></li><li>Adjust wind settings from none to strong<br></li><li>Choose the total number of rounds, maximum turns in each round and the length of each turn</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Battle by yourself or with friends against the computer and other players in this turn-based combat game! Learn new spells after each round (if you can afford them) to add to your arsenal. Choose your game mode, customize your preferences and may the best mage win!",
